    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8d802fb5427c4763a8f725316e1943fa",
      "statement": "Allstars_ID is the join key across Users, Enrollments, Beneficiaries, and Audit_Log. It must be named exactly Allstars_ID and hold the same value in all four sheets; a user is resolved by Work_Email from Users and the resulting Allstars_ID is threaded into every downstream lookup (enrollment, beneficiary, audit).",
