    {
      "id": "claim_d228532c7e504443b10f692d01e4831c",
      "statement": "The Enrollments sheet holds the current cycle state in one row per employee, updated in place (not append-only). First_Enrolled_Date is set once on first enrollment and never overwritten; its emptiness drives the wasFirstEnrollment flag. Current_Enrolled_Date drives tenure/match-tier/vesting when Withdrawal_Count >= 1 (re-enrollment restarts tenure there). Current_Plan is a decimal that doubles as the enrolled flag (set = enrolled, blank = not enrolled); Investment_Plan must exist as a column or processEnrollment errors.",
      "evidence": [
