    {
      "id": "claim_29901da822ec450d9e04c8526923eb1f",
      "statement": "Beneficiaries is an append-only ledger: each update appends a row {Timestamp, Allstars_ID, Work_Email, Beneficiary_Data(JSON)} and no row is ever edited or deleted. The current active set is the newest matching row, read bottom-up by getUserProfile; every match is also pushed into beneficiaryHistory so full history is preserved. The prior state is the previous matching row, so the beneficiary audit event carries no priorValues.",
