    {
      "id": "claim_9b96452ea1714067ba88c1df2fb96df5",
      "statement": "Beneficiary_Data is a JSON-stringified array of {name, rel, pct, address} objects stored in a single cell. name includes a title prefix baked in at the front (นาย/นาง/นางสาว/ด.ช./ด.ญ. or Mr./Ms./Mrs.); rel is the English key (Parent/Spouse/Child/Sibling/Relative/Friend); each pct >= 1 and all pct sum to exactly 100; name, rel, address all required. Audit_Log.Event_Data is a JSON object (not array) with priorValues/newValues plus post-commit stamps.",
