    {
      "id": "claim_69ffa17c32644920aad54dfb84d9f10b",
      "statement": "Audit_Log is an append-only audit trail. Each action appends a SUBMITTED row keyed by Transaction_ID + Event_Type; cancelTransaction appends a separate CANCELLED row with the same Transaction_ID for continuity. getPendingTransactions deduplicates by keeping the latest event per Transaction_ID (compared by Timestamp).",
