    {
      "id": "claim_e6d8dac0cbdf48bdb3b5a3c8f6a21edf",
      "statement": "App_Feedback stores post-action 1-5 star ratings and must be created manually with headers in row 1 (the app does not create it). submitFeedback resolves Allstars_ID from Users inside a try/catch and leaves it blank if not found; rating is validated server-side (1-5, else rejected). It is best-effort by design because it is called after the action already succeeded, so a feedback failure must never imply the action failed.",
