    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f8b2fff6c30e4e85b5cdae8ef3ff329a",
      "statement": "getPendingTransactions reads Audit_Log and keeps only the latest row per Transaction_ID for the user's Allstars_ID, then filters to cancellable actions (Enroll, Change Plan, Withdraw) whose latest event is SUBMITTED or EDITED and isWithinEditableWindow(submittedAt). Beneficiary and investment-plan actions log SUBMITTED rows but are deliberately excluded because they are effective immediately with no cancel state.",
